meta {
  name: Dishes
  seq: 3
}

docs {
  Dishes of {{restaurant}} (set in the environment). Run in order: List
  dishes stores the first dish's ID in `firstDishId`, and Create dish
  stores the new ID in `dishId`, for the requests after them. IDs are
  22-character base62 UUIDs. Prices are integer minor units (cents) in the
  restaurant's currency, ZAR for the demo restaurants.
}
